{
  "id": "42",
  "title": "女命贱格",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“女命贱格”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀混杂。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-dc9730ec0214f913ac99-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "官杀无制。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-d751b98434cecf6d669e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "杀星太重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-d0d825bece0a4ea9b9aa-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官太重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-d99ae303b436ced707b3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "贪财坏印。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-99d665fce6a37b459642-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "比肩犯重。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-8eed277450186c4411e7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无官见合。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-9971d9cfd05b691a1e68-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "无印见杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-2595b12e2406c4a6578e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官七杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-7da20ff594da3cbdd118-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "带合桃花。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-d67d3c17309a9ca2c498-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "八字刑冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-82e1674e1d51ed73675d-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财多身弱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-5c16025075e3f3592afe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "阳刃冲刑。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-135f2d4f61edbb4c7ec8-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "金神带刃。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-25d3a3c8cde87abd9997-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "多官多合。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-6fd48465e9ce03dc783a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "倒插桃花。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-41676b801e47c3d6f633-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "身旺无依。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-e7e66baf3c1dbf24b4d0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官见官。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-6ae0d26ed23302999a1c-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "财官遇印。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-25d95df4a06afb35ded3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "印綬遇劫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-56a7d74faba3c8f7f430-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "【渊海子平】赋论",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "42-0d5167b73d2f1ac5eddc-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
